  id: lore_belfry
  displayName: The Cantors' Count
  description: Scratched on a cairn at the foot of the belfry ridge.
  kind: 3
  price: 0
  heal: 2
  damageBoost: 1.25
  boostBeats: 16
  teaches: 
  loreText: 'UP HERE THE BELL COUNTS THREE. THE DEAD STILL DANCE TO IT: ONE, THEY STEP; TWO, THREE, THEY SWAY. WHEN THEY RAISE BOTH BLADES, THEY STRIKE ONE-TWO-THREE. WHEN THEY HOLD ON TWO, THEY STRIKE ON THREE.'
  color: {r: 0.6039216, g: 0.72156864, b: 1, a: 1}
